      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Mesquite's older neighborhoods east of Dallas along I-635 and I-30 are full of fences that have outlived their first run. Call now and compare written quotes from independent fence contractors.</p>
