<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Fencing in Mesquite usually starts with an old fence that has finally given up. Many homes east of Dallas along I-635 and I-30 went up in the 1970s through the 1990s, and the original wood fence on a lot of them is leaning, grey and shedding pickets. The real question is rarely whether to act, but whether to repair a section or replace the whole run.</p><p>White Rock Fence Co is an advertising site, not a fence contractor. It connects Mesquite homeowners with independent fence contractors who quote the work, and it builds nothing itself. Call now at (214) 555-0137, then compare two or three written quotes. For wider pricing context, see <a href="/fence-cost-dallas/">fence costs in Dallas</a>.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Mesquite</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Mesquite Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3DFD8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A3035;margin:0 0 8px;">Wood privacy fence installation</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Cedar or pine privacy fences, including board-on-board, for Mesquite back yards. The City of Mesquite caps rear yard fences at 8 feet, so ask each contractor to quote the exact height you want.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3DFD8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A3035;margin:0 0 8px;">Fence repair</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Leaning sections, rotted posts and missing pickets on older Mesquite fences. Ask each contractor to price a repair and a full replacement side by side, because the City's permit rule applies when 50 percent or more of a fence is replaced.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3DFD8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A3035;margin:0 0 8px;">Gate repair and automatic gates</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Sagging walk gates, drive gates that drag and openers that quit. Power wiring for a gate opener is electrical work, so ask the installer who holds the electrical license.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3DFD8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A3035;margin:0 0 8px;">Wrought iron fences</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Steel and iron-style fences for front yards and side gates. Mesquite limits a front yard fence to 3 1/2 feet with 50 percent through-vision, which an open iron design can meet, so confirm the details with the City.</p>
      </div>
</div>
